  '2026 NFL Season Preview: Top 5 Contenders in Each Conference',
  'nfl-2026-season-preview-top-contenders',
  'Breaking down the top contenders in the AFC and NFC for the 2026 NFL season. From powerhouse dynasties to rising challengers — who has the best shot at the Lombardi Trophy?',
  'The 2026 NFL season is shaping up to be one of the most competitive in recent memory. Here''s our breakdown of the top contenders in each conference.\n\nAFC Contenders:\n\n1. Kansas City Chiefs — Until someone proves otherwise, the road to the Super Bowl runs through Arrowhead.\n2. Buffalo Bills — Josh Allen remains the most physically gifted QB in the league. Can the Bills finally break through?\n3. Baltimore Ravens — Lamar Jackson and a retooled offense make Baltimore dangerous.\n4. Cincinnati Bengals — Healthy Burrow + Chase = Super Bowl aspirations.\n5. Houston Texans — The young core is poised for a leap.\n\nNFC Contenders:\n\n1. San Francisco 49ers — The most complete roster in football.\n2. Philadelphia Eagles — Jalen Hurts leads a balanced, physical team.\n3. Detroit Lions — The feel-good story isn''t over yet.\n4. Dallas Cowboys — Talent everywhere; the question is execution.\n5. Green Bay Packers — The youngest roster in the league keeps getting better.\n\nNo matter which team you support, NFL Fan Shop has premium gear for all 32 franchises. T-shirts from $34.99, dresses from $59.99, free US shipping on every order.',
