  'How to Style Your NFL Game-Day Outfit: T-Shirt vs. Dress Guide',
  'nfl-game-day-outfit-guide-tshirt-vs-dress',
  'Struggling to choose between a team t-shirt and a game-day dress? Our style guide breaks down when to wear each, outfit pairings, and what works best for different game-day settings.',
  'Game day is sacred. Whether you''re heading to the stadium, a tailgate party, or a sports bar — your outfit matters. Here''s how to choose between our popular NFL t-shirts ($34.99) and game-day dresses ($59.99).\n\nWhen to Wear a Team T-Shirt:\n\n- Casual watch parties at home or a friend''s place\n- Tailgating — pair with jeans and a team cap\n- Running errands on game day morning\n- Layering under a jacket for cold-weather games\n- Gym or casual outings to rep your team year-round\n\nOur t-shirts feature a 60/40 cotton-polyester blend that breathes well in warm weather and layers comfortably under hoodies or jackets. The unisex fit works great for all fans.\n\nWhen to Wear a Game-Day Dress:\n\n- Stadium games — stand out in the crowd\n- Sports bars and watch parties where you want to dress up\n- Pre-game brunches and events\n- Warm-weather games when you want a one-piece outfit\n- Any occasion where you want maximum team spirit with minimum effort\n\nThe A-line silhouette flatters all body types, and the knee-length cut keeps it tasteful. Available in XS-3XL.\n\nPro Tip: Many fans own both! Grab a t-shirt for everyday wear and a dress for special game days.',
