  'NFL free agency always reshapes the league landscape, and 2026 was no exception. Here are the moves that matter most and what they mean for your team.\n\nBiggest Impact Signings:\n\n1. AFC North arms race — all four teams made significant additions, making this the most competitive division in football.\n2. NFC West reload — the 49ers and Seahawks both added key pieces to keep pace.\n3. Quarterback carousel — several teams found new signal-callers, potentially shifting the balance of power.\n\nWhat This Means for Fans:\n\nIf your team made big moves, there''s renewed optimism heading into the season. New stars in new cities mean new jersey numbers to rep. If your team stayed quiet, don''t worry — draft capital and internal development are just as important.\n\nEither way, NFL Fan Shop has you covered with fresh gear for every team. Our t-shirts ($34.99) featuring the latest team colors and designs help you celebrate the new season in style.\n\nStay tuned for our draft coverage and team-by-team breakdowns coming soon.',
